diff --git a/changelog.txt b/changelog.txt
index d88acd2834c734..ef201e029fb78f 100644
--- a/changelog.txt
+++ b/changelog.txt
@@ -1,5 +1,390 @@
 == Changelog ==
 
+= 23.5.0-rc.1 =
+
+## Changelog
+
+### Enhancements
+
+- Style Engine: Export public TypeScript types. ([79079](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79079))
+- Widget Primitives: Decouple discovery from a hardcoded endpoint. ([79322](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79322))
+- Widget Primitives: Make `@types/react` an optional peer dependency. ([79272](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79272))
+
+#### Components
+- Add corner radius presets to ThemeProvider. ([78816](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/78816))
+- Autocomplete: Add Group and GroupLabel primitives. ([78901](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/78901))
+- Base Styles: Add wpds-var Sass helper for design token fallbacks. ([78698](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/78698))
+- BaseControl: add text-wrap: Pretty. ([79112](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79112))
+- BoxControl: Hard deprecate 40px default size. ([79419](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79419))
+- Components, DataViews: Adopt --wpds-dimension-size-* tokens. ([79093](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79093))
+- ESLint, UI, Components: Mark `Tooltip` from `@wordpress/ui` as recommended. ([78693](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/78693))
+- Popover: Add open/close motion and fix close re-anchor. ([78885](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/78885))
+- Theme: Add Figma scopes to element size tokens. ([79032](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79032))
+- Theme: Add disabled variants for brand and error interactive color tokens. ([79124](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79124))
+- Theme: Add stroke-surface tokens for the caution tone. ([79198](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79198))
+- Theme: Apply ThemeProvider styles inline (I2). ([78678](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/78678))
+- Theme: Differentiate `--wpds-color-fg-interactive-{brand,error}-active` vs resting state tokens. ([79151](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79151))
+- Theme: Enforce sRGB seed-color input contract for ThemeProvider. ([79148](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79148))
+- Theme: Provide design-system token defaults without a runtime `<ThemeProvider>`. ([78664](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/78664))
+- Theme: Skip serializing `data-wpds-root-provider="false"` on non-root providers. ([79253](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79253))
+- Theme: forward ThemeProvider cornerRadius preset to :Root for root providers. ([79153](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79153))
+- UI Field.Description: add `text-wrap: Pretty`. ([79143](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79143))
+- UI: Disable instant overlay popup transitions. ([79432](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79432))
+- UI: Simplify focus ring styles. ([78823](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/78823))
+- UI: Use isomorphic layout effects for SSR. ([79458](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79458))
+- Update `@ariakit/react` to 0.4.29. ([79055](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79055))
+- [DataViewsPicker]: `DataViewsPicker.BulkActionToolbar` now renders only the bulk-selection info and action buttons. ([79180](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79180))
+- theme: Rename `bg`/`fg` design token groups to `background`/`foreground`. ([79098](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79098))
+
+#### Block Library
+- Add support for aspect ratio and related controls in viewport states. ([78795](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/78795))
+- Audio: Apply `inert` directly instead of wrapping in `Disabled`. ([79423](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79423))
+- Classic Block: Port PHPUnit coverage for hiding it from the inserter. ([79434](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79434))
+- Cover block: Add media editor modal. ([79258](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79258))
+- File Block: Combine audio/video/image to file transforms. ([79242](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79242))
+- File Block: Replace on-mount downloadButtonText effect with a default variation. ([79236](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79236))
+- Icon Block: Add flip and rotate transformation controls. ([77017](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/77017))
+- Icon block: Default to core/info via block.json instead of an insert-time effect. ([79212](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79212))
+- Icon block: Move flip controls to toolbar group. ([79192](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79192))
+- Icons block: Insert an icon by default. ([79111](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79111))
+- Math format: Seed LaTeX input from the current selection. ([79052](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79052))
+- Pullquote: Migrate to text-align block support. ([79225](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79225))
+- Remove orphaned `convertToListItems` util. ([79400](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79400))
+- Search block: Add opt-in support for the semantic <search> element. ([78485](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/78485))
+- Tabs: Simplify layout and prune redundant block supports. ([77646](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/77646))
+- Try: Remove Tab (Tab list item) block. ([77439](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/77439))
+- Video: Apply `inert` directly instead of wrapping in `Disabled`. ([79371](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79371))
+
+#### Post Editor
+- Block Editor: Allow overriding `disableContentOnlyForTemplateParts` setting. ([79191](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79191))
+- Editor: Hide cmd palette shortcut in document bar when admin bar is shown. ([79060](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79060))
+- Feature: Need to add “Show More” / “Show Less” toggle in Note. ([77446](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/77446))
+- Notes: Simplify 'Show more/less' collapse logic. ([79261](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79261))
+- Rename `Toolbar in editor` experiment to match iteration issue. ([79074](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79074))
+- Revisions screen with picker-activity layout. ([77333](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/77333))
+- Style states: Use symbols for property keys to avoid clashes. ([79210](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79210))
+
+#### Site Editor
+- Add xl border radius token for page shell surfaces. ([78913](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/78913))
+- Change 'Identity' nav item position. ([79292](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79292))
+- Handle `aria-current` natively in `SidebarNavigationItem`. ([79305](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79305))
+- Introduce isHidden prop for SidebarNavigationItem. ([79352](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79352))
+- Omnipresent toolbar: Show site icon instead of dashicon if set. ([79049](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79049))
+- Update spelling within the welcome tour. ([53028](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/53028))
+
+#### Block Editor
+- Add flex vertical alignment tool to block inspector layout panel. ([79426](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79426))
+- Correct behaviour of flex child fixed width and introduce max width option. ([79073](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79073))
+- Global Styles: Add textShadow style support. ([73320](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/73320))
+- List View block support: Hide list tab when allowedBlocks is empty, with no children. ([78932](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/78932))
+- Pattern editing: Show root block identity when editing pattern sections. ([79417](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79417))
+
+#### Media
+- Media Editor Modal: Add a loading and simple error state. ([79101](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79101))
+- Media Editor: Magnify the crop to fill the canvas. ([79044](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79044))
+- Media Fields: Ensure the current post is always included in the initial options. ([79467](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79467))
+- Media editor: Snap crop handles to source pixels. ([79139](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79139))
+
+#### Data Layer
+- RTC: Allow disabling collaboration by post type. ([78984](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/78984))
+- TextControl: Hard deprecate 40px default size. ([79386](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79386))
+- View Config: Request a subset of properties with the `_fields` parameter. ([79355](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79355))
+
+#### Client Side Media
+- Media: Rename HEIC companion metadata key to source_image. ([79307](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79307))
+- Upload Media: Add error taxonomy, localized messages, and dev diagnostics. ([74917](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/74917))
+- Vips: Inline WASM with compact UTF-8 binary encoding instead of base64. ([79188](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79188))
+
+#### Dashboard
+- Boot: Run page `init` modules in `initSinglePage`. ([79394](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79394))
+- Widget Dashboard: Extract into `@wordpress/widget-dashboard`. ([79268](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79268))
+
+#### npm Packages
+- Grid: Prepare `@wordpress/grid` for npm publishing as experimental 0.1.0. ([79071](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79071))
+- Widget Primitives: Extract into `@wordpress/widget-primitives`. ([79134](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79134))
+
+#### DataViews
+- View configuration API and REST Endpoint: Make them core ready. ([79347](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79347))
+
+#### Plugin
+- Bump minimum required WordPress version to 6.9. ([79196](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79196))
+
+#### Global Styles
+- Global styles revisions: Replace active text with badge. ([79137](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79137))
+
+#### Icons
+- Add media control and backup icons. ([78987](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/78987))
+
+#### Block bindings
+- Block bindings : Add support to list-item. ([78947](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/78947))
+
+
+### New APIs
+
+#### Site Editor
+- Theme: Promote ThemeProvider to stable API. ([78958](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/78958))
+
+
+### Bug Fixes
+
+- Block Bindings: Preserve nested lists when binding List Item content. ([79346](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79346))
+- Elements tests: Accept both md5 and sequential `wp-elements-*` class names. ([79300](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79300))
+- Plugins API: Fix the plugin 'render' property validation. ([79315](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79315))
+- V2 Site Editor: Fix template edit routes. ([79230](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79230))
+- wp-build: Return null from getPackageInfo on resolve miss instead of throwing. ([78715](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/78715))
+
+#### Post Editor
+- Block Fields: Fix crash resolving pattern overrides bindings. ([79092](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79092))
+- DataFormPostSummary: Fix different `useSelect` returned values. ([79478](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79478))
+- Editor: Disable saving while a non-post entity is being saved. ([79069](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79069))
+- Editor: Guard PostViewLink against post types without a labels object. ([79160](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79160))
+- Mark all controlled/mode block changes non-persistent. ([79350](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79350))
+- RTC: Fix code editor cursor jumping to the end on remote sync. ([79005](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79005))
+- Revisions: Ignore empty `[]/{}` meta values in the Meta diff panel. ([79185](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79185))
+- Style Book: Fix crash when previewing variations for blocks without examples. ([79131](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79131))
+
+#### Block Library
+- Avoid dirtying related navigation entities during passive render. ([79000](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79000))
+- Custom HTML: Fix scrollbar becoming non-functional after switching tabs. ([78571](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/78571))
+- Gallery: Hide Navigation button type when lightbox editing is disabled. ([79147](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79147))
+- Image block: Remove duplicate data-wp-bind--srcset in the lightbox overlay. ([79202](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79202))
+- Image: Fix pasted images stretching when dimensions are preserved. ([79067](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79067))
+- Navigation block: Fix responsive style states for typography settings. ([79072](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/79072))
+
+#### Components
